<title>USA: Fed's 9-day fixed system RPs total $2.955 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed's 9-day fixed system RPs total $2.955 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's injection of 9-day fixed system repurchase agreements on Tuesday totalled $2.955 billion, a New York Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the Fed's overnight and 6-day system RPs were $4.500 billion and $6.504 billion, respectively.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867</p>
